roup at admission, discharge, 3 months after discharge; ‐ Patients' satisfaction with pharmaceutical care after the patients terminate the study plan (Questionnaire: "Assessement of the pharmaceutical care service", developed by PhD Sonja Koch in the course of her study "A pilot study regarding pharmaceutical care of patient with coronary heart disease", descriptiv, only patients of the intervention group) INCLUSION CRITERIA: ‐Patients admitted on open wards P21 and P31 independent of their diagnosis ‐ age>17 ‐ Possibility to independently complete questionnaires ‐possibility to understand written and spoken German ‐ soundness of mind ‐ hospital stay more than 7 days ‐ willingness to be contacted after discharge
