T1  - Fluctuations in grandiose and vulnerable narcissistic states: A momentary perspective
JF  - Journal of personality and social psychology
A1  - Edershile Elizabeth A
A1  - Wright Aidan G. C
KW  - eppi-reviewer
KW  - Psychology
KW  - Borderline personality disorder
