T1  - Effectiveness of Rational Emotive Behaviour Therapy in Clinical Social Work: Impact on Frequency of Visits and Use of Psychopharmacological Treatment.
JF  - International Journal of Integrated Care (IJIC)
A1  - Aler Carme Rovira
A1  - Leiva Maria Isabel Fuentes
A1  - Bonet Xavier Fernández
