T1  - Friday, September 28, 2018 3:00 PM–4:00 PM abstracts: optimizing lumbar disc surgery: 215. Patients presenting with a lumbar far-lateral herniated nucleus pulposus can expect similar postoperative outcomes to those presenting with a central or paracentral herniation
JF  - Spine Journal
A1  - Basques Bryce
A1  - Louie Philip
A1  - Carroll Deven
A1  - Nolte Michael T
A1  - Heidt Steven T
A1  - Paul Justin C
A1  - Varthi Arya G
A1  - Goldberg Edward J
A1  - An Howard S
