T1  - THE EFFICACY OF COGNITIVE-BEHAVIOURAL THERAPY (CBT) AS RELATED TO SLEEP QUALITY AND HYPERAROUSAL LEVEL IN THE TREATMENT OF PRIMARY INSOMNIA
