T1  - Latino Community Health Workers: Meeting their Community's Emotional Needs in Intuitively Culturally Appropriate Ways
JF  - PROGRESS IN COMMUNITY HEALTH PARTNERSHIPS-RESEARCH EDUCATION AND ACTION
