T1  - Lessons learned from the London Exercise and Pregnant (LEAP) Smokers randomised controlled trial process evaluation: implications for the design of physical activity for smoking cessation interventions during pregnancy.
JF  - BMC Public Health
A1  - Giatras Nikoletta
