T1  - Improving balance and mobility in people over 50 years of age with vision impairments: can the Alexander Technique help? A study protocol for the VISIBILITY randomised controlled trial
JF  - INJURY PREVENTION
A1  - Gleeson M
A1  - Sherrington C
A1  - Borkowski E
A1  - Keay L
KW  - eppi-reviewer
PY  - 2014
DA  - 2014///
