AB  - Polypharmacy can be a significant health hazard when used inappropriately. Among the various age groups, polypharmacy is a significant issue among elderly. Among elderly, polypharmacy is a rule rather than the exception. Polypharmacy is not limited to the specialty of psychiatry alone but is prevalent throughout the practice of medicine. Polypharmacy is often associated with an increased risk of adverse effects of medications, as well as drug interactions, poor medication adherence, and higher cost of treatment.
