T1  - How distress is understood and communicated by women patients detained in high secure forensic healthcare, and how nurses interpret that distress: An exploration using a multi-perspective interpretative phenomenological analysis
T2  - Dissertation Abstracts International: Section B: The Sciences and Engineering
A1  - Jones Jane
KW  - eppi-reviewer
KW  - Multi-Perspective Interpretative Phenomenological Analysis
KW  - Distress
